                "description": "The Civica Case Management platform is a multi-channel contact and case management solution\nproviding end-to-end support for any case management process – capturing, managing, responding\nto as well as analysing performance and trends. Also providing dedicated pre-configured template\nsolutions for Complaint and Feedback Management, Information Request Handling, Legal Case\nManagement, Registrations, Coroners as well as Employee Relations case management.Introducing the CIVICA system for DPIA’s, SAR’s and Incident and breach Management will deliver\nmeasurable efficiency gains across the core Information Governance (IG) function",
